# Post image creation (Syra) — always on

Whenever the user asks to create, design, make, generate, or iterate a **post image**, **announce card**, **thread image**, **square promo still**, or **X/Twitter graphic** for Syra:

1. Read [`web/src/content/announce/REFERENCE_LIBRARY.md`](web/src/content/announce/REFERENCE_LIBRARY.md).
2. Match content to an archetype using the table there (and optionally `findBestReference()` in [`web/src/content/announce/referenceLibrary.ts`](web/src/content/announce/referenceLibrary.ts)).
3. **Open the matching reference PNG with the Read tool** before designing (agents must see the image, not only the path).

## Match vs invent

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Clear match (metrics, flow, quote, checklist, etc.) | Reuse that archetype’s layout + chrome. Swap copy/modules. Prefer Satori (`xlayerCards.ts` + `templatesXLayer.tsx`) over AI-baked text. |
| Several possible | Pick the one whose **primary module** fits. One job per card. |
| No good match | Invent a **new** design. Keep system chrome. **Read all 7 reference PNGs** (+ bg plates) and compose a new layout in the same studio language. After user approval, register it in the library. |

## System chrome (required)

- White atmospheric bg plate + crisp Satori overlay
- Top-left Syra mark + wordmark; top-right mono label
- Boxed black headline stickers; glossy dark content modules
- Mono disclaimer footer; black/white/gray only unless user asks otherwise
- Default **1:1 / 1080×1080** for announce cards

Gold reference: `web/public/images/threads/syra-xlayer-showcase.png` (Design 2).

## Pipeline

1. Classify content → pick or invent archetype.
2. Read reference image(s).
3. Update or add defs in `web/src/content/announce/xlayerCards.ts`.
4. Layout in `web/src/components/post/photo/satori/templatesXLayer.tsx` (real wrapper components; no `<>` fragment body helpers — Satori layout bug).
5. New bg plates → `web/public/images/threads/bg/bg-<id>.png` (no text/logos on the plate).
6. Export: `npm run generate:xlayer` from `web/`.
7. Deliver PNGs under `web/public/images/threads/syra-xlayer-<id>.png` and update `REFERENCE_LIBRARY.md` + `referenceLibrary.ts` when adding a new archetype.

## Do not

- Ship flat white cards with no atmospheric plate
- Bake final body/headline text into AI images (use Satori for type)
- Invent a different brand frame (colored gradients, purple AI look, gold chrome) unless the user explicitly overrides
- Skip reading the reference PNG when a match exists
